	(text "ADF5901 TX SHEET (Task 13) -- integrated into the Rev C root schematic\nU5 ADF5901WCCPZ. TXOUT1(2)->C50 100pF DC-block->TX_ANT (to TX antenna feed).\nTXOUT2(7) UNUSED per reference design: EV-RADAR-MMIC2 Fig.10 (top block schematic) and\nFig.13 (ADF5901 pin-level schematic) route TX_OUT1 and TX_OUT2 IDENTICALLY -- each to its\nown SMA jack (J8/J9), with NO dummy load or termination resistor on either output. This\nsheet replicates that exactly: TX2 gets the same DC-block treatment into an open/unused\nlocal net, not a 50-ohm termination.\nLOOUT(11)->C52 100pF->LO_OUT (to ADF5904 LO_IN). AUX(27)->C53 100pF->RFIN_DIV (to ADF4159\nRFinA, which is normally ac-coupled from ADF5901 AUX per adf4159.md). AUXB(28) locally\ndecoupled to GND (100pF) -- not routed off-sheet, mirroring ADF4159's own RFinB\n'~100pF to GND' treatment since only single-ended AUX drives the PLL feedback.\nDecoupling triads (0.1uF+1nF+10pF) per rail from adf5901.md App-circuit values +\nev-radar-mmic2.md Fig.13 (TX_AHI; RF_AHI+AHI combined per Fig.13's shared AHI net;\nVCO_AHI separate; DVDD separate). 4 distinct +3V3_TX stubs (TX_AHI[4,5]; RF_AHI+AHI[14,16];\nVCO_AHI[30]; DVDD[17]) -- merged into one +3V3_TX net by the root sheet at Task 15; DVDD\ntriad C18-C20 added post-review. C1-pin=47nF, C2-pin=220nF,\nVREG=220nF per datasheet Table 4 pin descriptions. RSET=5.1k to GND (R22 in ref design).\nREFIN(15) connects to the PLL sheet's post-coupling 100 MHz TCXO reference through the\nproject-global REFIN net. ATEST(9), DOUT(24), MUXOUT(25) explicit no-connects -- not in\nthis sheet's interface (SPI_SDO/RAMP_SYNC are sourced elsewhere per the interface contract)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-0000001000f3")
	)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/" (page "1"))
	)
